[D Quests for Naxxramas \\ https://github.com/JanRK/Guidelime_DungeonQuests]
[N 60 40man Naxxramas]
[NX 60 40man Onyxia]

Naxxramas is the Scourge necropolis floating over the Plaguewood in the north of the Eastern Plaguelands. Every quest here starts and ends at Light's Hope Chapel. To get in you need the Argent Dawn attunement from Archmage Angela Dosantos (Honored or better); then you take the teleport spire in the middle of the Plaguewood up into the necropolis.

-- Left out: 9034-9118 (Tier 3 class sets: Dreadnaught, Bonescythe, Dreamwalker, Frostfire, Plagueheart, Cryptstalker, Earthshatter, Redemption, Faith): one-off gear exchanges that need raid-drop tokens and Frozen Runes; pick the pieces at the Light's Hope quartermasters when you have the drops.
-- Left out: 9234-9246 (Icebane, Glacial, Polar, Icy Scale crafting quests): profession reward quests for Frozen Runes, not part of the raid route.
-- Questie: QuestieQuestBlacklist:Load hides 9033 and 9121-9123 only from Cataclysm on, and 9120, 9229, 9230, 9232, 9233 only from Wrath on, so all are live on Forever (Era rules).

-- Both: get to Light's Hope Chapel (the Stratholme and Scholomance guides walk there).
[A Alliance] At Khaelyn Steelwing in Light's Hope Chapel, get the flight path [P Light's Hope Chapel] [G71.7,49.6 Eastern Plaguelands]
[A Horde] At Georgia in Light's Hope Chapel, get the flight path [P Light's Hope Chapel] [G70.4,47.6 Eastern Plaguelands]
Archmage Angela Dosantos sells the attunement; take the one your Argent Dawn rank allows (Honored: 5 Arcane Crystals, 2 Nexus Crystals, a Righteous Orb and 60 gold; Revered: less; Exalted: free) [QA9121 The Dread Citadel - Naxxramas][QA9122 The Dread Citadel - Naxxramas][QA9123 The Dread Citadel - Naxxramas] [G71.7,48.7 Eastern Plaguelands]
Hand the attunement straight back to her [QT9121 The Dread Citadel - Naxxramas][QT9122 The Dread Citadel - Naxxramas][QT9123 The Dread Citadel - Naxxramas] [G71.7,48.7 Eastern Plaguelands]
At Commander Eligor Dawnbringer, take Echoes of War [QA9033 Echoes of War] [G71.7,48.6 Eastern Plaguelands]

-- Approach: Light's Hope road south-west, then north through the Plaguewood (same road as the Stratholme Undead guide).
Down the road west and north to the Plaguewood [G66.1,58.0 Eastern Plaguelands][G60.5,43.2 Eastern Plaguelands][G52.2,31.6 Eastern Plaguelands][G44.0,19.0 Eastern Plaguelands] [OC] \\ Elite Fallen Heroes (58-59) walk near the chapel; elite Crimson Bodyguards (57-58) and a Crimson Courier (60) ride near 51,31; the elite abomination Borelgore (61) roams near 48,25; Monstrous Plaguebats (56-58) by the Plaguewood; Putrid Gargoyles (54-56) near 62,48 and Living Decay (55-56) near 64,51 west of the chapel.
West to the teleport spire in the middle of the Plaguewood and step on the rune circle to enter Naxxramas [G39.0,26.0 Eastern Plaguelands] \\ Spire spot from warcraft.wiki.gg, not checked in game.

In Naxxramas, kill Living Monstrosities, Stoneskin Gargoyles, Deathknight Captains and Venom Stalkers [QC9033 Echoes of War]
*Optional:* if Omarion's Handbook drops (Military Quarter), loot it and start the quest [QA9233 Omarion's Handbook]
*Optional:* if the Phylactery of Kel'Thuzad drops, take the quest it starts [QA9120 The Fall of Kel'Thuzad]

-- Back at Light's Hope Chapel.
Leave the spire and walk the road back south-east to Light's Hope Chapel [G44.0,19.0 Eastern Plaguelands][G52.2,31.6 Eastern Plaguelands][G60.5,43.2 Eastern Plaguelands][G66.1,58.0 Eastern Plaguelands][G71.7,49.9 Eastern Plaguelands] [OC]
Turn in Echoes of War at Commander Eligor Dawnbringer [QT9033 Echoes of War] [G71.7,48.6 Eastern Plaguelands]
At Korfax, take The Fate of Ramaladni; it is done inside Naxxramas on a later run [QA9229 The Fate of Ramaladni] [G72.0,48.5 Eastern Plaguelands]
*Optional (later run):* complete The Fate of Ramaladni in Naxxramas [QC9229 The Fate of Ramaladni]
*Optional:* turn it in at Korfax [QT9229 The Fate of Ramaladni] [G72.0,48.5 Eastern Plaguelands]
*Optional:* with a Frozen Rune, Blue Sapphire and Arcanite Bar, take and hand in Ramaladni's Icy Grasp [QA9230 Ramaladni's Icy Grasp][QT9230 Ramaladni's Icy Grasp] [G72.0,48.5 Eastern Plaguelands]
*Optional:* turn in The Fall of Kel'Thuzad at Father Inigo Montoy [QT9120 The Fall of Kel'Thuzad] [G71.7,48.6 Eastern Plaguelands]
*Optional:* turn in Omarion's Handbook at Craftsman Wilhelm [QT9233 Omarion's Handbook] [G71.2,49.9 Eastern Plaguelands]
*Optional:* with 2 Frozen Runes, 2 Essence of Water, 2 Blue Sapphires and 30 gold, take and hand in The Only Song I Know... at Craftsman Wilhelm [QA9232 The Only Song I Know...][QT9232 The Only Song I Know...] [G71.2,49.9 Eastern Plaguelands]
